After conducting thorough research, I've discovered a method to enable Docker secrets by implementing an entry script. This script populates the necessary environment variables before initiating the application. This pull request is inspired by [this repository](https://github.com/DevilaN/docker-entrypoint-example/tree/main), and I've made modifications to enhance its functionality, specifically by adding generic support for the _FILE postfix.

I've also included a comprehensive example to demonstrate how the script should be utilized.

